# Audiobookshelf on Railway — environment reference
#
# The deploy form is intentionally EMPTY: this template needs zero variables.
# Railway injects PORT automatically; the wrapper bakes everything else in.
#
# Informational (all have working defaults, override post-deploy if needed):
#
# PORT            - HTTP listen port. Injected by Railway (default 8080).
#                   Upstream honors process.env.PORT natively.
# CONFIG_PATH     - App config dir incl. SQLite DB. Baked to /data/config
#                   (Railway volume mount).
# METADATA_PATH   - Covers/cache dir. Baked to /data/metadata (volume).
# TZ              - Container timezone, e.g. America/Vancouver
